         <strong>J/B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of \n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               up to 2/99 or \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from 2/99.</p><p>The coil of the relay \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R2</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is energized\nby an earth signal when one of the steering switches is closed;\nthese switches are connected via the clock spring to the stalk unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                  